title: "Hybrid post-quantum key exchange in production TLS 1.3: measurement code and data"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Sarjeant
    given-names: Judith Ann
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-5012-9694"
    affiliation: "Golden Gate University"
version: "1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
license: CC-BY4.0
  - keywords:
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - ML-KEM
  - TLS 1.3
  - hybrid key exchange
  - X25519MLKEM768
  - measurement
abstract: >-
  Notebook and data for a reproducible client-side measurement of hybrid
  X25519MLKEM768 versus classical X25519 key exchange in TLS 1.3 against three
  public endpoints, using OpenSSL 3.5.4 from a qBraid cloud vantage: seven
  sessions and 1,260 handshakes (October and November 2026), with ClientHello
  and ServerHello captures and paired analysis outputs.
